<section class="ingredients section" id="ingredientes" style="background-image: url('https://promo.ozenvitta.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/06-DOBRA-OZENPHARMA.jpg'); background-size: cover; background-position: center;">
  <div class="ingredients__overlay"></div>
  
  <div class="container ingredients__container">
    <div class="ingredients__header text-center">
      <span class="section-label">100% NATURAL</span>
      <h2 class="section-title text-white">
        Suplemento 100% Natural
      </h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle" style="color: white; opacity: 0.9;">
        Conheça os ingredientes da fórmula
      </p>
      <p class="ingredients__intro">
        Combinamos os melhores ingredientes naturais, cuidadosamente selecionados para potencializar seus resultados de forma segura e eficaz.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="ingredients__grid">
      <div class="ingredient-card">
        <img src="https://promo.ozenvitta.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/image-1.png" alt="Chia" />
        <h3>Chia</h3>
        <p>Ajuda a aumentar a saciedade e contribui para emagrecimento.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="ingredient-card">
        <img src="https://promo.ozenvitta.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/image-2.png" alt="Laranja Moro" />
        <h3>Laranja Moro</h3>
        <p>Auxilia no metabolismo de gorduras, especialmente a abdominal.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="ingredient-card">
        <img src="https://promo.ozenvitta.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/image-3.png" alt="L-Carnitina" />
        <h3>L-Carnitina</h3>
        <p>Auxilia no transporte de gordura para produção de energia.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="ingredient-card">
        <img src="https://promo.ozenvitta.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/image-4.png" alt="Quitosana" />
        <h3>Quitosana</h3>
        <p>Reduz a absorção de gorduras na alimentação.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="ingredient-card">
        <img src="https://promo.ozenvitta.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/image-5.png" alt="Psyllium" />
        <h3>Psyllium</h3>
        <p>Melhora a digestão e combate o inchaço.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="ingredient-card">
        <img src="https://promo.ozenvitta.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/image-6.png" alt="Espirulina" />
        <h3>Espirulina</h3>
        <p>Rica em proteínas e vitaminas, controla o apetite.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="ingredient-card">
        <img src="https://promo.ozenvitta.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/image-7.png" alt="Cálcio e Zinco" />
        <h3>Cálcio e Zinco</h3>
        <p>Regulam o metabolismo saudável.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="ingredient-card">
        <img src="https://promo.ozenvitta.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/image-8.png" alt="Cromo" />
        <h3>Cromo</h3>
        <p>Melhora a sensibilidade à insulina e reduz o desejo por doces.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="ingredient-card">
        <img src="https://promo.ozenvitta.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/image-9.png" alt="Inulina" />
        <h3>Inulina</h3>
        <p>Auxilia a flora intestinal e ajuda a emagrecer.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="ingredient-card">
        <img src="https://promo.ozenvitta.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/image-10.png" alt="L-Arginina" />
        <h3>L-Arginina</h3>
        <p>Responsável por dar mais energia e disposição.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="ingredient-card">
        <img src="https://promo.ozenvitta.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/image-11.png" alt="L-Tirosina" />
        <h3>L-Tirosina</h3>
        <p>Melhora a concentração e a flexibilidade cognitiva.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="ingredient-card">
        <img src="https://promo.ozenvitta.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/image-12.png" alt="Trans-Resveratrol" />
        <h3>Trans-Resveratrol</h3>
        <p>Antioxidante que pode contribuir para a saúde do coração.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="text-center" style="margin-top: 48px; position: relative; z-index: 1;">
      <a href="#oferta" class="btn btn--primary">
        Quero emagrecer
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .ingredients {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 80vh;
  }

  .ingredients__overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(36, 110, 178, 0.9) 0%, rgba(36, 53, 111, 0.95) 100%);
  }

  .ingredients__container {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .ingredients__header {
    margin-bottom: 64px;
  }

  .ingredients__intro {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 24px auto 0;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .ingredients__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .ingredient-card {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 24px 16px;
    text-align: center;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ingredient-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-8px);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
  }

  .ingredient-card img {
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    margin: 0 auto 16px;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  .ingredient-card h3 {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-dark);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .ingredient-card p {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  @media (max-width: 992px) {
    .ingredients__grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .ingredients__grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .ingredients__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
